{"k":{"t01-apar-0":"<span class=\"ln\" data-korpo=\"12.6pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">EXPLANATORY BOOKLET</span> <span class=\"ln\" data-korpo=\"8.4pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">FOR</span> <span class=\"ln lg\" data-korpo=\"15.6pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">the Delmas Auxiliary Charts</span> <span class=\"orn\">❦</span> <span class=\"ln\" data-korpo=\"13.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">FIRST SERIES</span> <span class=\"fil\"></span>","t01-apar-1":"<span class=\"ln lg\" data-korpo=\"15.0pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">CHART No. 1</span> <span class=\"ln lg\" data-korpo=\"11.4pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">The School. — The Secondary School. — The Classroom.</span> <span class=\"fil\"></span>","t01-tit-1":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">General description.</span>","t01-01-1":"1. — This chart shows a <b>classroom</b> in a <b>secondary school</b>. In this classroom there are eight <b>tables</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.339325,0.560105,0.009987,0.010154\" data-n=\"18\" title=\"tables\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(18)</sup></button> and eight <b>benches</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.298491,0.886341,0.009543,0.012447\" data-n=\"32\" title=\"bancs\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(32)</sup></button>. Three pupils sit on each bench. The <b>teacher</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.104527,0.503767,0.004882,0.010481\" data-n=\"7\" title=\"professeur\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(7)</sup></button> sits on a <b>chair</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.072792,0.542745,0.00466,0.012119\" data-n=\"8\" title=\"chaise\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(8)</sup></button> at his <b>desk</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.134043,0.602358,0.00466,0.011137\" data-n=\"6\" title=\"chaire\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(6)</sup></button>.","t01-02-1":"2. — To the left of the desk stands a glass-fronted <b>cabinet</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.188859,0.618736,0.008877,0.010481\" data-n=\"15\" title=\"armoire vitrée\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(15)</sup></button>. To the right is the <b>blackboard</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.016644,0.59679,0.003329,0.010481\" data-n=\"1\" title=\"tableau noir\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(1)</sup></button> with the <b>cloth</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.034842,0.685228,0.005548,0.010154\" data-n=\"2\" title=\"torchon\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(2)</sup></button> and the <b>chalk</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.055704,0.744186,0.004882,0.010481\" data-n=\"3\" title=\"craie\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(3)</sup></button>.","t01-02-2":"Above the desk hang <b>wall charts</b> <sup>(<button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.042166,0.4887,0.00466,0.010481\" data-n=\"9\" title=\"tableaux muraux\" aria-expanded=\"false\">9</button>, <button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.097426,0.279725,0.007767,0.010481\" data-n=\"11\" title=\"tableaux muraux\" aria-expanded=\"false\">11</button>, <button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.170883,0.311824,0.009099,0.010481\" data-n=\"12\" title=\"tableaux muraux\" aria-expanded=\"false\">12</button>)</sup> and a <b>map</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.117843,0.250901,0.009099,0.010481\" data-n=\"10\" title=\"carte géographique\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(10)</sup></button>.","t01-03-1":"3. — Not all the pupils are in their <b>seats</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.290945,0.528005,0.011096,0.010809\" data-n=\"17\" title=\"place\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(17)</sup></button>. John <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.006658,0.712414,0.00577,0.010481\" data-n=\"4\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(4)</sup></button> is standing at the board; he is holding the cloth and wiping off the <b>geometrical figures</b>.","t01-03-2":"Peter is near the desk; he is collecting the <b>written exercises</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.092543,0.64756,0.005104,0.010809\" data-n=\"5\" title=\"copies\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(5)</sup></button> and bringing them to the teacher.","t01-04-1":"4. — <b>This</b> teacher is the teacher of <b>modern languages</b>. He teaches the pupils to speak, read and write foreign languages <b>(German, English, Spanish, Italian, Russian</b> or <b>French)</b>.","t01-05-1":"5. — The classroom is very large and very bright. At the far end there is a wide <b>window</b> with two <b>transoms</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.336662,0.236489,0.010209,0.010481\" data-n=\"78\" title=\"vasistas\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(78)</sup></button> and a <b>glazed door</b> to air it and light it.","t01-05-2":"This classroom is not cold. In the middle, to heat it, there is a very good <b>stove</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.543054,0.73567,0.011984,0.010809\" data-n=\"46\" title=\"poêle\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(46)</sup></button> with its <b>pipe</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.506214,0.622666,0.010431,0.011464\" data-n=\"45\" title=\"tuyau\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(45)</sup></button>.","t01-05-3":"<b>Coat hooks</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.908566,0.720275,0.009543,0.011464\" data-n=\"58\" title=\"portemanteaux\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(58)</sup></button> are fixed to the partition; the pupils’ hats and coats hang from them.","t01-tit-2":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">The playground.</span>","t01-06-1":"6. — The <b>clock</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.781846,0.21225,0.010874,0.010481\" data-n=\"63\" title=\"horloge\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(63)</sup></button> says five past nine.","t01-06-2":"<b>Break</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.38016,0.384212,0.010874,0.010481\" data-n=\"76\" title=\"récréation\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(76)</sup></button> has just ended and the lesson is starting again. Break is held in the <b>yard</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.36285,0.442516,0.008655,0.010154\" data-n=\"75\" title=\"cour\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(75)</sup></button>. We can see a few pupils playing. An <b>assistant master</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.419441,0.372093,0.011318,0.010481\" data-n=\"74\" title=\"maître répétiteur\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(74)</sup></button> is supervising them.","t01-07-1":"7. — In the yard we can also see various other people: the <b>inspector</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.400355,0.432689,0.010652,0.010481\" data-n=\"73\" title=\"inspecteur\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(73)</sup></button>, the <b>headmaster</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.47692,0.431379,0.008655,0.010809\" data-n=\"71\" title=\"proviseur\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(71)</sup></button> and the <b>deputy head</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.441411,0.428431,0.010652,0.010481\" data-n=\"72\" title=\"censeur\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(72)</sup></button>.","t01-07-2":"The inspector inspects the schools, the headmaster runs the school, the deputy head oversees the pupils’ work.","t01-07-3":"The fourth figure is the <b>caretaker</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.33644,0.429414,0.010652,0.010481\" data-n=\"77\" title=\"concierge\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(77)</sup></button>. He is carrying a register under his arm to record the absentees.","t01-08-1":"8. — At the far end of the yard are the <b>gymnastic apparatus</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.467599,0.393384,0.009543,0.009826\" data-n=\"70\" title=\"appareils de gymnastique\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(70)</sup></button> and the workshop for <b>handicrafts</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.559698,0.471995,0.010874,0.010481\" data-n=\"69\" title=\"travaux manuels\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(69)</sup></button>.","t01-08-2":"To the right of the chart we can just make out the <b>classrooms</b> for <b>music</b> and <b>drawing</b>.","t01-tit-3":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">Detailed description.</span>","t01-tit-4":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">The good pupils.</span>","t01-09-1":"9. — The pupils on the first bench to the right of the desk are <b>Henry</b> <button class=\"apel\" data-noto=\"en-t01-noto-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\">(*)</button>, <b>Stephen</b> and <b>Charles</b>.","t01-09-2":"Henry is very attentive and hard-working; he is listening to the teacher. On his table he has an <b>exercise book</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.230581,0.868981,0.010209,0.011464\" data-n=\"28\" title=\"cahier\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(28)</sup></button>, a <b>book</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.199068,0.863085,0.010209,0.010481\" data-n=\"29\" title=\"livre\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(29)</sup></button>, a <b>dictionary</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.159565,0.891582,0.010874,0.011137\" data-n=\"30\" title=\"dictionnaire\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(30)</sup></button> and a <b>pencil case</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.214603,0.905011,0.009543,0.011137\" data-n=\"31\" title=\"plumier\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(31)</sup></button>. His book has many <b>pages</b>; each chapter contains several <b>paragraphs</b> and each <b>line</b> many <b>words</b>.","t01-09-4":"His neighbour Stephen <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.291389,0.81035,0.012206,0.010154\" data-n=\"24\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(24)</sup></button> is keen. He is writing down in his exercise book the lesson set for next time. He has fine <b>handwriting</b>. His book is closed. We can see only the <b>cover</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.201287,0.804455,0.010431,0.010809\" data-n=\"27\" title=\"couverture\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(27)</sup></button>. Beside him lies his pair of <b>compasses</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.21771,0.820832,0.010874,0.010809\" data-n=\"26\" title=\"compas\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(26)</sup></button>.","t01-09-5":"Charles <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.270084,0.730102,0.009987,0.011137\" data-n=\"23\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(23)</sup></button> is holding his book in his hand; he is opening it to go over his lesson again. Like every pupil, he has an <b>inkwell</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.241456,0.717982,0.011318,0.009826\" data-n=\"25\" title=\"encrier\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(25)</sup></button> in front of him. He is obedient.","t01-10-1":"10. — At the next table are <b>Louis, Anthony</b> and <b>Paul</b>. Louis is reciting his <b>lesson</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.365291,0.645922,0.010652,0.010481\" data-n=\"22\" title=\"leçon\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(22)</sup></button> and answering the teacher’s <b>questions</b>. Anthony <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.329117,0.630855,0.009099,0.010481\" data-n=\"21\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(21)</sup></button> is very inattentive; sometimes the teacher even punishes him. Paul <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.334665,0.600721,0.010874,0.010809\" data-n=\"20\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(20)</sup></button> is a good friend, pleasant and obliging. He is very attentive.","t01-tit-5":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">The bad pupils.</span>","t01-11-1":"11. — Behind Henry sits <b>George</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.543276,0.87455,0.010209,0.010481\" data-n=\"38\" title=\"Georges\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(38)</sup></button>. He is not a bad lad, but he is <b>talkative</b>, inattentive and fidgety. His <b>frivolity</b> and <b>disobedience</b> cause <b>disruption</b> during the lesson, and he often deserves a stern <b>warning</b>. His <b>rough book</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.486906,0.885686,0.009987,0.010809\" data-n=\"35\" title=\"cahier de brouillon\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(35)</sup></button> is dirty, he covers it with <b>ink blots</b> from his <b>pen</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.513316,0.936456,0.011762,0.008516\" data-n=\"34\" title=\"plumo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(34)</sup></button>, which is why he always uses his <b>eraser</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.478695,0.859155,0.010874,0.011137\" data-n=\"36\" title=\"gomme à effacer\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(36)</sup></button>; his <b>satchel</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.454949,0.912217,0.010431,0.012119\" data-n=\"33\" title=\"serviette\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(33)</sup></button> is torn, for he is very careless. Why does he bring his <b>pencil holder</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.496671,0.864723,0.009987,0.010481\" data-n=\"37\" title=\"portecrayon\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(37)</sup></button> to the modern languages classroom?","t01-11-2":"His neighbour Edmund <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.53573,0.800852,0.010209,0.010481\" data-n=\"39\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(39)</sup></button> does not like him. He is admittedly a little lazy, but he is quiet and still. He does not chatter; only, instead of listening, he prefers to read the <b>stories</b> in his <b>reader</b>.","t01-11-3":"The third pupil on this bench is <b>Ludovic</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.483577,0.767114,0.011096,0.010809\" data-n=\"40\" title=\"Ludovic\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(40)</sup></button>. He is diligent. He is writing on a white <b>sheet of paper</b>. In front of him he has laid his <b>blotting paper</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.432091,0.739928,0.009099,0.010481\" data-n=\"41\" title=\"buvard\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(41)</sup></button>.","t01-12-1":"12. — The pupils on the second bench, to the teacher’s left, are very young. The first, little <b>Emil</b>, cannot write well yet; he brings his <b>slate</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.45162,0.655421,0.011318,0.010481\" data-n=\"42\" title=\"ardoise\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(42)</sup></button>, his <b>slate pencil</b> and his <b>sponge</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.437195,0.627252,0.011096,0.010809\" data-n=\"43\" title=\"éponge\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(43)</sup></button>.","t01-12-2":"Next to him are <b>Augustus</b> and <b>Bernard</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.437195,0.591549,0.011984,0.009499\" data-n=\"44\" title=\"Bernard\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(44)</sup></button>. The latter works well, but his <b>appearance</b> is very untidy.","t01-13-1":"13. — Behind them sit three <b>idlers</b>. <b>Albert</b> does not learn his lessons. <b>James</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.629161,0.611857,0.010874,0.010809\" data-n=\"47\" title=\"Jacques\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(47)</sup></button> is asleep instead of listening. His <b>idleness</b> earns him <b>reprimands</b> and even <b>punishments</b>. Lastly <b>Christian</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.679982,0.61153,0.009987,0.010154\" data-n=\"48\" title=\"Christian\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(48)</sup></button> is far too flippant. He <b>behaves</b> badly and makes no effort to mend his ways.","t01-14-1":"14. — Their neighbours, by contrast, are well behaved. <b>Ernest</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.699956,0.702588,0.007989,0.010809\" data-n=\"51\" title=\"Ernest\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(51)</sup></button> likes order and regularity; he always uses his <b>ruler</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.692632,0.793318,0.008877,0.010809\" data-n=\"50\" title=\"règle\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(50)</sup></button> and his <b>pencil</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.671993,0.744841,0.010209,0.009171\" data-n=\"49\" title=\"crayon\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(49)</sup></button>. He is a <b>day pupil</b>.","t01-14-2":"<b>Francis</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.780293,0.754012,0.009543,0.011137\" data-n=\"52\" title=\"François\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(52)</sup></button> is a <b>boarder</b>; he wears the uniform, and eats and sleeps at the school. He is a good <b>friend</b>.","t01-14-3":"Maurice is sharpening his <b>pencil</b> with his <b>penknife</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.786951,0.886341,0.010431,0.010481\" data-n=\"56\" title=\"canif\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(56)</sup></button>; he is very careful.","t01-14-4":"He brings all his books, his <b>grammar</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.732801,0.892892,0.009543,0.010481\" data-n=\"55\" title=\"grammaire\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(55)</sup></button>, his <b>notebook</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.709055,0.857845,0.011096,0.010481\" data-n=\"54\" title=\"carnet de notes\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(54)</sup></button>, and even a <b>writing pad</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.762761,0.880118,0.010209,0.010481\" data-n=\"53\" title=\"sous-main\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(53)</sup></button>. His <b>school bag</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.930537,0.91451,0.010209,0.010809\" data-n=\"57\" title=\"sac de classe\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(57)</sup></button> is on the floor behind him.","t01-14-5":"The two tables at the back of the classroom are taken by <b>good pupils</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.337772,0.507042,0.008433,0.010809\" data-n=\"19\" title=\"bons élèves\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(19)</sup></button>.","t01-tit-6":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">Drawing and music.</span>","t01-15-1":"15. — In the <b>drawing room</b> there are handsome <b>models</b> hung on the wall and a <b>lamp</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.975144,0.45922,0.009765,0.010809\" data-n=\"62\" title=\"lampe\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(62)</sup></button> with a <b>shade</b>, hanging from the ceiling. The <b>teacher</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.81447,0.575827,0.009543,0.011464\" data-n=\"60\" title=\"professeur\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(60)</sup></button> is very patient; he corrects the pupils’ <b>drawings</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.891034,0.610219,0.007324,0.009826\" data-n=\"61\" title=\"dessins\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(61)</sup></button> and teaches them to draw a <b>bust</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.976476,0.514248,0.009987,0.010481\" data-n=\"59\" title=\"buste\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(59)</sup></button> from life.","t01-16-1":"16. — The <b>music room</b> looks very interesting. There one learns to read <b>music</b>, to sing the <b>scale notes</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.753884,0.423845,0.011096,0.010481\" data-n=\"67\" title=\"notes\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(67)</sup></button> written on the <b>stave</b> (do, re, mi, fa, sol, la, si = C. D. E. F. G. A. B.), to know the <b>clefs</b> and to sing charming <b>melodies</b>. The scores are placed on the <b>music stand</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.640257,0.466099,0.010431,0.010481\" data-n=\"65\" title=\"pupitre\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(65)</sup></button>. One of the pupils is <b>playing the piano</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.758766,0.510645,0.010652,0.010809\" data-n=\"64\" title=\"piano\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(64)</sup></button> and the <b>music teacher</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.699512,0.461513,0.009099,0.010809\" data-n=\"66\" title=\"professeur de musique\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(66)</sup></button> is <b>beating time</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.725477,0.447101,0.010431,0.010481\" data-n=\"68\" title=\"mesure\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(68)</sup></button>.","t01-17-1":"17. — We can just see a corner of the <b>workshop</b> for <b>handicrafts</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.559698,0.471995,0.010874,0.010481\" data-n=\"69\" title=\"travaux manuels\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(69)</sup></button>, where the children may learn to plane wood and file iron. Not every school has one.","t01-tit-7":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">The science room.</span>","t01-18-1":"18. — The mathematics teacher teaches the pupils <b>geometry,</b> <b>arithmetic, calculation</b> and the <b>metric system</b>. On the chart we can see the main geometrical figures: a <b>circle</b> <sup>(<button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.019633,0.658661,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"a\" title=\"cercle\" aria-expanded=\"false\">a</button>)</sup>, a <b>square</b> <sup>(<button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.052468,0.626557,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"b\" title=\"carré\" aria-expanded=\"false\">b</button>)</sup>, a <b>triangle</b> <sup>(<button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.049811,0.67077,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"c\" title=\"triangle\" aria-expanded=\"false\">c</button>)</sup>, a <b>line</b> <sup>(<button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.035173,0.739874,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"d\" title=\"ligne\" aria-expanded=\"false\">d</button>)</sup>.","t01-18-2":"We can also see a <b>sum</b>; it is not an <b>addition</b>, nor a <b>subtraction</b>, nor a <b>multiplication</b>: it is a <b>division</b> <sup>(<button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.065565,0.676005,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"e\" title=\"division\" aria-expanded=\"false\">e</button>)</sup>.","t01-19-1":"19. — On the metric system chart we can see: a <b>metre</b> <sup>(<button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.052217,0.380286,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"a\" title=\"mètre\" aria-expanded=\"false\">a</button>)</sup>, a <b>balance</b> <sup>(<button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.015161,0.379639,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"b\" title=\"balance\" aria-expanded=\"false\">b</button>)</sup> and its <b>weights</b>, a <b>litre</b> <sup>(<button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.059978,0.343932,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"e\" title=\"litre\" aria-expanded=\"false\">e</button>)</sup>, a <b>decalitre</b> <sup>(<button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.013372,0.258796,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"f\" title=\"décalitre\" aria-expanded=\"false\">f</button>)</sup>, a <b>decilitre</b> and a <b>cubic metre</b> <sup>(<button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.03224,0.324944,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"d\" title=\"mètre cube\" aria-expanded=\"false\">d</button>)</sup>.","t01-19-2":"The pupils also study <b>natural science</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.097426,0.279725,0.007767,0.010481\" data-n=\"11\" title=\"tableaux muraux\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(11)</sup></button> — zoology <sup>(<button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.124098,0.290533,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"a\" title=\"zoologie\" aria-expanded=\"false\">a</button>)</sup>, botany <sup>(<button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.132317,0.3652,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"b\" title=\"botanique\" aria-expanded=\"false\">b</button>)</sup>, geology <sup>(<button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.127443,0.431354,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"c\" title=\"géologie\" aria-expanded=\"false\">c</button>)</sup> — and <b>history</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.170883,0.311824,0.009099,0.010481\" data-n=\"12\" title=\"tableaux muraux\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(12)</sup></button>.","t01-19-3":"In the cabinet are the instruments for <b>physics</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.188859,0.618736,0.008877,0.010481\" data-n=\"15\" title=\"armoire vitrée\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(15)</sup></button> and for <b>chemistry</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.230138,0.5755,0.009321,0.010481\" data-n=\"16\" title=\"chimie\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(16)</sup></button>.","t01-19-4":"On top of the cabinet are: a <b>sphere</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.189525,0.419915,0.009987,0.010481\" data-n=\"14\" title=\"sphère\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(14)</sup></button>, a <b>cone</b> and a <b>globe</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.175322,0.387815,0.010209,0.011464\" data-n=\"13\" title=\"globe terrestre\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(13)</sup></button>.","t01-19-5":"Above the charts hangs a <b>map</b> showing the five parts of the world: <b>Europe</b> <sup>(<button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.20951,0.166394,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"g\" title=\"Europe\" aria-expanded=\"false\">g</button>)</sup>, <b>Asia</b> <sup>(<button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.161802,0.143808,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"e\" title=\"Asie\" aria-expanded=\"false\">e</button>)</sup>, <b>Africa</b> <sup>(<button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.155821,0.230267,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"f\" title=\"Afrique\" aria-expanded=\"false\">f</button>)</sup>, <b>America</b> <sup>(<button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.073486,0.101258,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"a\" title=\"Amérique\" aria-expanded=\"false\">a</button><button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.084585,0.148741,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"b\" title=\"Amérique\" aria-expanded=\"false\">b</button>)</sup> and <b>Oceania</b> <sup>(<button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.209077,0.256781,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"h\" title=\"Océanie\" aria-expanded=\"false\">h</button>)</sup>, and the two great oceans, the <b>Pacific</b> <sup>(<button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.036213,0.146461,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"c\" title=\"Océan Pacifique\" aria-expanded=\"false\">c</button>)</sup> and the <b>Atlantic</b> <sup>(<button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.116538,0.161832,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"d\" title=\"Océan Atlantique\" aria-expanded=\"false\">d</button>)</sup>. <span class=\"fil\"></span>"},"noto":{"t01-noto-1":"(*) For <i>first names</i> it is also recommended to transcribe them in their Latin form. That is the only way to avoid countless variants. Besides, how would one choose between <i>Giovanni, Jean, Johann,</i> <i>Jan, Hans, John, Ivan,</i> and so on? Are we to create a special dictionary of first names? Let us take the Latin nominative and say: <b>Ioannes, Ioanna; Iulius, Iulia; Iakobus; Andreas; Lukas.</b> (Complete Grammar)."}}
